---
import ArrowIcon from "../components/ArrowIcon.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Brand kit"
  description="The pH7Builder brand idea, visual system, colours and official logo assets for open-source dating, matchmaking and community products."
  path="/brand/"
>
  <header class="brand-hero">
    <div class="shell brand-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">pH7Builder brand kit</p>
        <h1>Connection, assembled with care.</h1>
        <p class="lede">A human identity for an open-source product foundation. Built for dating, matchmaking and communities without looking like another generic software company.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/brand/ph7builder-wordmark.svg" download>Download the wordmark<ArrowIcon /></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/brand/ph7builder-mark.svg" download>Download the mark<ArrowIcon /></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-stage" aria-label="pH7Builder wordmark on the brand colour system">
        <img src="/brand/ph7builder-wordmark.svg" alt="pH7Builder" width="760" height="220" />
        <p>Build the place where people find each other.</p>
        <div aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section brand-principles">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Brand idea</p><h2>Human on top. Solid underneath.</h2></div>
        <p>The identity brings together the emotional purpose of social dating products and the clarity expected from independently owned open-source software.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-grid">
        <article><span>♥</span><h3>Human</h3><p>Show member moments and real product decisions before implementation detail.</p></article>
        <article><span>⌘</span><h3>Independent</h3><p>Make ownership, inspectable source and self-hosting concrete rather than ideological.</p></article>
        <article><span>✦</span><h3>Inventive</h3><p>Build specific product worlds. Avoid the visual language of generic AI SaaS.</p></article>
        <article><span>✓</span><h3>Honest</h3><p>Use verified capability and clear limitations instead of inflated promises.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section palette-section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Signal palette</p><h2>Every colour has a job.</h2></div>
        <p>Night ink grounds the product. Lime signals the open foundation. Coral marks human connection. Violet brings product energy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="palette-grid" aria-label="pH7Builder colour palette">
        <div class="swatch swatch-ink"><strong>Night ink</strong><span>#18132D</span></div>
        <div class="swatch swatch-coral"><strong>Connection coral</strong><span>#FF6D85</span></div>
        <div class="swatch swatch-lime"><strong>Builder lime</strong><span>#C9F45B</span></div>
        <div class="swatch swatch-violet"><strong>Electric violet</strong><span>#5D4DFF</span></div>
        <div class="swatch swatch-paper"><strong>Warm canvas</strong><span>#FFF5EF</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight shell brand-usage">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Use it well</p><h2>Keep the identity recognisable, not repetitive.</h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>Use one dominant statement and one strong product visual per page. Connection paths should describe a real relationship or journey. Hard shadows belong on important objects, not every container.</p>
      <p>Fictional people and products must remain clearly labelled. Never manufacture customers, testimonials, usage figures or business outcomes.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/pH7Software/website/blob/main/docs/BRAND.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the complete brand guidance<ArrowIcon /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .brand-hero { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem); overflow: hidden; }
  .brand-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(25rem, 0.75fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .brand-hero h1 { max-width: 10ch; }
  .brand-stage { position: relative; display: flex; min-height: 34rem; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 2rem; background: var(--coral); box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--ink); transform: rotate(1.5deg); }
  .brand-stage::before { position: absolute; top: 28%; left: -10%; width: 120%; height: 55%; border: 2px dashed var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; content: ""; transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  .brand-stage img { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 1rem; background: var(--paper-strong); }
  .brand-stage p { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 9ch; margin: auto 0 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 0.94; }
  .brand-stage > div { position: absolute; right: 2rem; bottom: 2rem; z-index: 2; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 2rem); gap: 0.4rem; }
  .brand-stage > div span { aspect-ratio: 1; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--lime); }
  .brand-stage > div span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--blue); }
  .brand-stage > div span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--yellow); }
  .brand-stage > div span:nth-child(4) { background: var(--paper-strong); }
  .brand-principles { border-block: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .brand-principles .section-heading p { color: #cbc5da; }
  .principle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .principle-grid article { min-height: 20rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--paper-strong); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--coral); }
  .principle-grid article:nth-child(2) { box-shadow-color: var(--lime); transform: translateY(2rem); }
  .principle-grid article:nth-child(3) { box-shadow-color: #9d8aff; }
  .principle-grid article:nth-child(4) { box-shadow-color: var(--yellow); transform: translateY(2rem); }
  .principle-grid article > span { display: grid; width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; place-items: center; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--coral); font-weight: 900; }
  .principle-grid h3 { margin-top: 5rem; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .principle-grid p { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .palette-section { background: var(--paper-strong); }
  .palette-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; }
  .swatch { display: flex; min-height: 17rem; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 1rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .swatch:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .swatch strong, .swatch span { display: block; }
  .swatch span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .swatch-ink { background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .swatch-coral { background: var(--coral); }
  .swatch-lime { background: var(--lime); }
  .swatch-violet { background: var(--blue); color: white; }
  .swatch-paper { background: var(--paper); }
  .brand-usage { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(20rem, 0.7fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); }
  .brand-usage h2 { max-width: 12ch; }
  .brand-usage > div:last-child { align-self: end; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .brand-hero-grid, .brand-usage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .principle-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .palette-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .swatch { min-height: 12rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); } }
  @media (max-width: 580px) { .brand-stage { min-height: 28rem; transform: none; } .brand-stage > div { display: none; } .principle-grid, .palette-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .principle-grid article, .principle-grid article:nth-child(2), .principle-grid article:nth-child(4) { min-height: auto; transform: none; } .principle-grid h3 { margin-top: 3rem; } .swatch { min-height: 9rem; border-right: 0; } }
</style>
